        rdfs:comment                   "Pair of re-covered shoes in blue and cream silk brocade, short and wide latches over wide tongue, with blue silk tape binding off edges, throat and seams on upper. The louis-heels still have got their original fabric in red, cream and green silk brocade. Leather sole and linen lining."@en , "Pair of shoes with blue and cream silk brocade covering original fabric, visible at heel."@en ;
